  "explanation": "Iterate through the sorted intervals in three steps: push all intervals that end before the new interval starts, merge all overlapping intervals into the new interval, then push remaining intervals.",
  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION insert(intervals, newInterval):\n    res = [], i = 0, n = LENGTH(intervals)\n    WHILE i < n AND intervals[i].end < newInterval.start DO:\n        APPEND intervals[i] TO res; i = i + 1\n    END WHILE\n    WHILE i < n AND intervals[i].start <= newInterval.end DO:\n        newInterval.start = MIN(newInterval.start, intervals[i].start)\n        newInterval.end = MAX(newInterval.end, intervals[i].end)\n        i = i + 1\n    END WHILE\n    APPEND newInterval TO res\n    WHILE i < n DO APPEND intervals[i] TO res; i = i + 1\n    RETURN res\nEND FUNCTION",
